{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01690",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.08,
      "end_seconds": 5.07,
      "duration_seconds": 3.99,
      "text": "Morning, doctor. Is this the right room?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.94,
      "end_seconds": 10.6,
      "duration_seconds": 4.66,
      "text": "You're alright, take a seat. What can I do for you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 11.9,
      "end_seconds": 18.72,
      "duration_seconds": 6.82,
      "text": "It's a stiff neck after sleeping badly. I thought I'd wait, but it hasn't gone."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 19.46,
      "end_seconds": 20.77,
      "duration_seconds": 1.31,
      "text": "Since when exactly?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 25.0,
      "end_seconds": 28.23,
      "duration_seconds": 3.23,
      "text": "I've had it for about a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 30.2,
      "end_seconds": 35.74,
      "duration_seconds": 5.54,
      "text": "Okay, give me more detail on it, whatever comes to mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 37.53,
      "end_seconds": 44.07,
      "duration_seconds": 6.54,
      "text": "It's worse with turning. I'd give it a eight, out of ten."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 45.88,
      "end_seconds": 48.01,
      "duration_seconds": 2.13,
      "text": "Is it accompanied by anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 49.31,
      "end_seconds": 69.42,
      "duration_seconds": 20.11,
      "text": "Tightness between my shoulders goes along with it, most of the time. The tightness between my shoulders? That's been for six months. As for tightness between my shoulders, it happens a couple of times a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 70.56,
      "end_seconds": 76.0,
      "duration_seconds": 5.44,
      "text": "I'll need to examine you for this, it won't take long."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 77.94,
      "end_seconds": 79.0,
      "duration_seconds": 1.06,
      "text": "Sure thing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 80.8,
      "end_seconds": 81.99,
      "duration_seconds": 1.19,
      "text": "Does that hurt?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 100.53,
      "end_seconds": 106.18,
      "duration_seconds": 5.65,
      "text": "The neck muscles on the left are tight and the movements are full."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 109.55,
      "end_seconds": 111.96,
      "duration_seconds": 2.41,
      "text": "That's all I needed to check."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 122.27,
      "end_seconds": 124.35,
      "duration_seconds": 2.08,
      "text": "And headache, any of that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 125.12,
      "end_seconds": 127.67,
      "duration_seconds": 2.55,
      "text": "Not at all, no headache."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 128.9,
      "end_seconds": 132.1,
      "duration_seconds": 3.2,
      "text": "Any fever, arm numbness or head injury?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 133.73,
      "end_seconds": 136.34,
      "duration_seconds": 2.61,
      "text": "No, nothing to report there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 137.34,
      "end_seconds": 140.11,
      "duration_seconds": 2.77,
      "text": "Has your heart given you any trouble?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 142.11,
      "end_seconds": 143.76,
      "duration_seconds": 1.65,
      "text": "Nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 144.34,
      "end_seconds": 148.71,
      "duration_seconds": 4.37,
      "text": "Alright, any health conditions I should have on record?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 152.11,
      "end_seconds": 170.0,
      "duration_seconds": 17.89,
      "text": "I have gout, for two years. I have diabetes, for five years. My sister suggested writing things down, but I forgot. I kept putting it off, which I know isn't sensible."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 170.78,
      "end_seconds": 174.53,
      "duration_seconds": 3.75,
      "text": "Ah. Alright, diabetes, that matches what I have here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 182.87,
      "end_seconds": 185.82,
      "duration_seconds": 2.95,
      "text": "What operations have you had, if any?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 187.85,
      "end_seconds": 191.58,
      "duration_seconds": 3.73,
      "text": "Just an operation for a hernia, last spring."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 193.64,
      "end_seconds": 196.59,
      "duration_seconds": 2.95,
      "text": "Have you got any known allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 198.4,
      "end_seconds": 203.33,
      "duration_seconds": 4.93,
      "text": "Plasters. I come out in... well, a red itchy rash."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 203.92,
      "end_seconds": 207.74,
      "duration_seconds": 3.82,
      "text": "Do you take any prescribed or over-the-counter medicines?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 209.71,
      "end_seconds": 213.55,
      "duration_seconds": 3.84,
      "text": "Paracetamol. I take it 1 gram, when needed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 214.06,
      "end_seconds": 217.3,
      "duration_seconds": 3.24,
      "text": "I follow. Do you work outside the home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 219.39,
      "end_seconds": 223.23,
      "duration_seconds": 3.84,
      "text": "I'm a hairdresser, on my feet all day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 224.33,
      "end_seconds": 226.49,
      "duration_seconds": 2.16,
      "text": "Do you do any exercise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 227.75,
      "end_seconds": 230.07,
      "duration_seconds": 2.32,
      "text": "I swim twice a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 230.94,
      "end_seconds": 232.97,
      "duration_seconds": 2.03,
      "text": "Is there someone at home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 234.95,
      "end_seconds": 238.67,
      "duration_seconds": 3.72,
      "text": "My husband and I live above the shop."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 240.02,
      "end_seconds": 247.93,
      "duration_seconds": 7.91,
      "text": "From what you've told me and what I found, this is probably a simple neck muscle strain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 248.49,
      "end_seconds": 250.75,
      "duration_seconds": 2.26,
      "text": "Is this serious, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 252.73,
      "end_seconds": 263.05,
      "duration_seconds": 10.32,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's a simple neck muscle strain, and we'll watch how it goes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 276.8,
      "end_seconds": 280.45,
      "duration_seconds": 3.65,
      "text": "Heat, gentle neck rolls, and a supportive pillow."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 280.96,
      "end_seconds": 290.1,
      "duration_seconds": 9.14,
      "text": "Hm, okay. Come back or go to emergency straight away if the symptoms get worse. Come back if not better in two weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 291.17,
      "end_seconds": 294.67,
      "duration_seconds": 3.5,
      "text": "Come by reception afterwards and I'll fix the appointment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 296.22,
      "end_seconds": 299.72,
      "duration_seconds": 3.5,
      "text": "I'll book it on my way out."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 300.96,
      "end_seconds": 306.63,
      "duration_seconds": 5.67,
      "text": "Can you run through the plan with me quickly, just to be certain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 308.37,
      "end_seconds": 315.18,
      "duration_seconds": 6.81,
      "text": "So, I come back if not better in two weeks. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 317.17,
      "end_seconds": 322.17,
      "duration_seconds": 5.0,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. I think we're done unless you have questions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 323.61,
      "end_seconds": 326.53,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "No, that's all. Thanks a lot."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 327.46,
      "end_seconds": 328.8,
      "duration_seconds": 1.34,
      "text": "Take care now."
    }
  ]
}